{"id":"b4255128a05df2e3","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/238_Mac_Lane_集合论_MAC.md","title":"238 Mac Lane 集合论 MAC","display":"238_Mac_Lane_集合论_MAC","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始符号\">1. 原始符号</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\">\\(\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\\)</span>，并令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Var}=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{Var}=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>。语言 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_{\\in}\">\\(\\mathcal L_{\\in}\\)</span> 只有二元关系符号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\in\">\\(\\in\\)</span>；项只有变量项。原始公式构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\doteq,\\quad \\in,\\quad \\neg,\\quad \\to,\\quad \\forall .\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\doteq,\\quad \\in,\\quad \\neg,\\quad \\to,\\quad \\forall .\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对有限 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq\\mathsf{Var}\">\\(X\\subseteq\\mathsf{Var}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fresh}(X)\">\\(\\operatorname{fresh}(X)\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 外最小下标变量。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-项与公式闭包\">2. 项与公式闭包</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Term}_{MAC}\">\\(\\mathsf{Term}_{MAC}\\)</span> 是由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{var}(x)\">\\(\\operatorname{var}(x)\\)</span> 生成的最小集合。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{MAC}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{MAC}\\)</span> 是由下列子句生成的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\doteq t\">\\(s\\doteq t\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{MAC}\">\\(s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{MAC}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in t\">\\(s\\in t\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{MAC}\">\\(s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{MAC}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\">\\(\\neg A\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{MAC}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{MAC}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\">\\(A\\to B\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{MAC}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{MAC}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall xA\">\\(\\forall xA\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{MAC}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{MAC}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>下列符号是展开缩写，均展开为第 2 节的原始构造子：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\wedge B:=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\qquad\nA\\vee B:=\\neg A\\to B,\\qquad\n\\exists xA:=\\neg\\forall x\\neg A,\\qquad\nA\\leftrightarrow B:=(A\\to B)\\wedge(B\\to A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\wedge B:=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\qquad\nA\\vee B:=\\neg A\\to B,\\qquad\n\\exists xA:=\\neg\\forall x\\neg A,\\qquad\nA\\leftrightarrow B:=(A\\to B)\\wedge(B\\to A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall x\\in a\\,A:=\\forall x(x\\in a\\to A),\\qquad\n\\exists x\\in a\\,A:=\\exists x(x\\in a\\wedge A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall x\\in a\\,A:=\\forall x(x\\in a\\to A),\\qquad\n\\exists x\\in a\\,A:=\\exists x(x\\in a\\wedge A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"3.-自由变量、替换与-$\\alpha$-等价\">3. 自由变量、替换与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>-等价</h1>\n<p>项自由变量函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}^{MAC}:\\mathsf{Term}_{MAC}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Var})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}^{MAC}:\\mathsf{Term}_{MAC}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Var})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}^{MAC}(\\operatorname{var}(x))=\\{x\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}^{MAC}(\\operatorname{var}(x))=\\{x\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义。公式自由变量函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{MAC}\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}_{MAC}\\)</span> 满足：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{MAC}(s\\doteq t)=\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}^{MAC}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}^{MAC}(t),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{MAC}(s\\in t)=\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}^{MAC}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}^{MAC}(t),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{MAC}(s\\doteq t)=\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}^{MAC}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}^{MAC}(t),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{MAC}(s\\in t)=\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}^{MAC}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}^{MAC}(t),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{MAC}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{MAC}(A),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{MAC}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{MAC}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{MAC}(B),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{MAC}(\\forall xA)=\\operatorname{FV}_{MAC}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{MAC}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{MAC}(A),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{MAC}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{MAC}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{MAC}(B),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{MAC}(\\forall xA)=\\operatorname{FV}_{MAC}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf T}^{MAC}:\\mathsf{Term}_{MAC}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Var}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{MAC}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{MAC}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Var}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf T}^{MAC}:\\mathsf{Term}_{MAC}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Var}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{MAC}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{MAC}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Var}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf T}^{MAC}(\\operatorname{var}(x))=\\varnothing,\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{MAC}(s\\doteq t)=\\operatorname{BV}_{MAC}(s\\in t)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf T}^{MAC}(\\operatorname{var}(x))=\\varnothing,\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{MAC}(s\\doteq t)=\\operatorname{BV}_{MAC}(s\\in t)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{MAC}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{BV}_{MAC}(A),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{MAC}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{BV}_{MAC}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{MAC}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{MAC}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{BV}_{MAC}(A),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{MAC}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{BV}_{MAC}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{MAC}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{MAC}(\\forall xA)=\\operatorname{BV}_{MAC}(A)\\cup\\{x\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{MAC}(\\forall xA)=\\operatorname{BV}_{MAC}(A)\\cup\\{x\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>项替换函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{T}^{MAC}:\\mathsf{Term}_{MAC}\\times\\mathsf{Var}\\times\\mathsf{Term}_{MAC}\\to\\mathsf{Term}_{MAC}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{T}^{MAC}:\\mathsf{Term}_{MAC}\\times\\mathsf{Var}\\times\\mathsf{Term}_{MAC}\\to\\mathsf{Term}_{MAC}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{var}(y)[x:=s]=\n\\begin{cases}\ns,&amp;y=x,\\\\\n\\operatorname{var}(y),&amp;y\\ne x.\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{var}(y)[x:=s]=\n\\begin{cases}\ns,&amp;y=x,\\\\\n\\operatorname{var}(y),&amp;y\\ne x.\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>公式替换函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{MAC}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{MAC}\\times\\mathsf{Var}\\times\\mathsf{Term}_{MAC}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{MAC}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{MAC}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{MAC}\\times\\mathsf{Var}\\times\\mathsf{Term}_{MAC}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{MAC}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>记作 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A[x:=s]\">\\(A[x:=s]\\)</span>，其子句为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(u\\doteq v)[x:=s]=(u[x:=s]\\doteq v[x:=s]),\n\\qquad\n(u\\in v)[x:=s]=(u[x:=s]\\in v[x:=s]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(u\\doteq v)[x:=s]=(u[x:=s]\\doteq v[x:=s]),\n\\qquad\n(u\\in v)[x:=s]=(u[x:=s]\\in v[x:=s]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\neg A)[x:=s]=\\neg(A[x:=s]),\n\\qquad\n(A\\to B)[x:=s]=(A[x:=s]\\to B[x:=s]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\neg A)[x:=s]=\\neg(A[x:=s]),\n\\qquad\n(A\\to B)[x:=s]=(A[x:=s]\\to B[x:=s]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C=\\forall yA\">\\(C=\\forall yA\\)</span>，则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C[x:=s]=\n\\begin{cases}\nC,&amp;y=x,\\\\\n\\forall y(A[x:=s]),&amp;y\\ne x\\ \\wedge\\ y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}^{MAC}(s),\\\\\n\\forall z((A[y:=\\operatorname{var}(z)])[x:=s]),&amp;y\\ne x\\ \\wedge\\ y\\in\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}^{MAC}(s),\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C[x:=s]=\n\\begin{cases}\nC,&amp;y=x,\\\\\n\\forall y(A[x:=s]),&amp;y\\ne x\\ \\wedge\\ y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}^{MAC}(s),\\\\\n\\forall z((A[y:=\\operatorname{var}(z)])[x:=s]),&amp;y\\ne x\\ \\wedge\\ y\\in\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}^{MAC}(s),\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"z=\\operatorname{fresh}(\\operatorname{FV}_{MAC}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}^{MAC}(s)\\cup\\{x,y\\}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[z=\\operatorname{fresh}(\\operatorname{FV}_{MAC}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}^{MAC}(s)\\cup\\{x,y\\}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_\\alpha^{MAC}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{MAC}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{MAC}\">\\(\\equiv_\\alpha^{MAC}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{MAC}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{MAC}\\)</span> 为所有等价关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 的交，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 满足：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(A,B)\\in E\\Rightarrow(\\neg A,\\neg B)\\in E,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(A,B)\\in E\\Rightarrow(\\neg A,\\neg B)\\in E,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(A_0,B_0)\\in E\\land(A_1,B_1)\\in E\n\\Rightarrow\n(A_0\\to A_1,B_0\\to B_1)\\in E,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(A_0,B_0)\\in E\\land(A_1,B_1)\\in E\n\\Rightarrow\n(A_0\\to A_1,B_0\\to B_1)\\in E,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(A,B)\\in E\\land x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\n\\Rightarrow\n(\\forall xA,\\forall xB)\\in E,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(A,B)\\in E\\land x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\n\\Rightarrow\n(\\forall xA,\\forall xB)\\in E,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并且当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{MAC}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}\">\\(y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{MAC}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}\\)</span> 时</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\forall xA,\\forall y(A[x:=\\operatorname{var}(y)]))\\in E.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\forall xA,\\forall y(A[x:=\\operatorname{var}(y)]))\\in E.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>等词和成员原子只与自身相容；没有额外原子改名子句。</p>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FreeRen}_{MAC}(A,x,y):=\\operatorname{Sub}_{MAC}(A,x,\\operatorname{var}(y)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FreeRen}_{MAC}(A,x,y):=\\operatorname{Sub}_{MAC}(A,x,\\operatorname{var}(y)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BoundRen}_{MAC}(\\forall xA,x,y):=\n\\forall y(A[x:=\\operatorname{var}(y)]),\n\\quad y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{MAC}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BoundRen}_{MAC}(\\forall xA,x,y):=\n\\forall y(A[x:=\\operatorname{var}(y)]),\n\\quad y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{MAC}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-$\\Delta_0$-与集合论缩写\">4. <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0\">\\(\\Delta_0\\)</span> 与集合论缩写</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0^{MAC}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{MAC}\">\\(\\Delta_0^{MAC}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{MAC}\\)</span> 是满足下列闭包条件的最小公式类：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{MAC}\">\\(s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{MAC}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\doteq t\\in\\Delta_0^{MAC}\">\\(s\\doteq t\\in\\Delta_0^{MAC}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in t\\in\\Delta_0^{MAC}\">\\(s\\in t\\in\\Delta_0^{MAC}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\Delta_0^{MAC}\">\\(A\\in\\Delta_0^{MAC}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\\in\\Delta_0^{MAC}\">\\(\\neg A\\in\\Delta_0^{MAC}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\Delta_0^{MAC}\">\\(A,B\\in\\Delta_0^{MAC}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A\\to B)\\in\\Delta_0^{MAC}\">\\((A\\to B)\\in\\Delta_0^{MAC}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\Delta_0^{MAC}\">\\(A\\in\\Delta_0^{MAC}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{MAC}\">\\(a\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{MAC}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x\\in a\\,A\\in\\Delta_0^{MAC}\">\\(\\forall x\\in a\\,A\\in\\Delta_0^{MAC}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists x\\in a\\,A\\in\\Delta_0^{MAC}\">\\(\\exists x\\in a\\,A\\in\\Delta_0^{MAC}\\)</span>（即展开式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x(x\\in a\\to A)\">\\(\\forall x(x\\in a\\to A)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists x(x\\in a\\wedge A)\">\\(\\exists x(x\\in a\\wedge A)\\)</span> 属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0^{MAC}\">\\(\\Delta_0^{MAC}\\)</span>）。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a\\subseteq b:=\\forall x(x\\in a\\to x\\in b),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a\\subseteq b:=\\forall x(x\\in a\\to x\\in b),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Empty}(e):=\\forall x\\neg(x\\in e),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Empty}(e):=\\forall x\\neg(x\\in e),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Pair}(p,a,b):=\\forall x(x\\in p\\leftrightarrow(x\\doteq a\\vee x\\doteq b)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Pair}(p,a,b):=\\forall x(x\\in p\\leftrightarrow(x\\doteq a\\vee x\\doteq b)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Union}(u,a):=\\forall x(x\\in u\\leftrightarrow\\exists y(y\\in a\\wedge x\\in y)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Union}(u,a):=\\forall x(x\\in u\\leftrightarrow\\exists y(y\\in a\\wedge x\\in y)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Power}(p,a):=\\forall x(x\\in p\\leftrightarrow x\\subseteq a),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Power}(p,a):=\\forall x(x\\in p\\leftrightarrow x\\subseteq a),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Succ}(x,y):=\\forall z(z\\in y\\leftrightarrow(z\\in x\\vee z\\doteq x)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Succ}(x,y):=\\forall z(z\\in y\\leftrightarrow(z\\in x\\vee z\\doteq x)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Inductive}(I):=\\exists e(\\operatorname{Empty}(e)\\wedge e\\in I)\\wedge\n\\forall x(x\\in I\\to\\exists y(\\operatorname{Succ}(x,y)\\wedge y\\in I)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Inductive}(I):=\\exists e(\\operatorname{Empty}(e)\\wedge e\\in I)\\wedge\n\\forall x(x\\in I\\to\\exists y(\\operatorname{Succ}(x,y)\\wedge y\\in I)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Trans}(T):=\\forall x\\forall y(x\\in y\\wedge y\\in T\\to x\\in T),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Trans}(T):=\\forall x\\forall y(x\\in y\\wedge y\\in T\\to x\\in T),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TCover}(a,T):=\\operatorname{Trans}(T)\\wedge a\\subseteq T.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{TCover}(a,T):=\\operatorname{Trans}(T)\\wedge a\\subseteq T.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-逻辑公理与规则\">5. 逻辑公理与规则</h1>\n<p>逻辑公理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}^{MAC}_{Log}=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{MAC}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{MAC}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{MAC}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall,1}^{MAC}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall,2}^{MAC}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{=,1}^{MAC}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{=,2}^{MAC},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}^{MAC}_{Log}=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{MAC}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{MAC}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{MAC}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall,1}^{MAC}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall,2}^{MAC}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{=,1}^{MAC}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{=,2}^{MAC},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{MAC}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{MAC}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{MAC}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{MAC}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{MAC}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{MAC}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{MAC}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{MAC}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{MAC}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{MAC}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{MAC}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{MAC}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall,1}^{MAC}=\\{(\\forall xA)\\to A[x:=t]:x\\in\\mathsf{Var},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{MAC},t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{MAC}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall,1}^{MAC}=\\{(\\forall xA)\\to A[x:=t]:x\\in\\mathsf{Var},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{MAC},t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{MAC}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall,2}^{MAC}=\\{(\\forall x(A\\to B))\\to(A\\to\\forall xB):x\\in\\mathsf{Var},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{MAC},x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{MAC}(A)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall,2}^{MAC}=\\{(\\forall x(A\\to B))\\to(A\\to\\forall xB):x\\in\\mathsf{Var},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{MAC},x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{MAC}(A)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{=,1}^{MAC}=\\{t\\doteq t:t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{MAC}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{=,1}^{MAC}=\\{t\\doteq t:t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{MAC}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{=,2}^{MAC}=\\{(s\\doteq t)\\to(A[x:=s]\\to A[x:=t]):x\\in\\mathsf{Var},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{MAC},s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{MAC}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{=,2}^{MAC}=\\{(s\\doteq t)\\to(A[x:=s]\\to A[x:=t]):x\\in\\mathsf{Var},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{MAC},s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{MAC}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>规则关系为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{MAC}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{MAC}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{MAC}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{MAC}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{Gen}^{MAC}=\\{((A),\\forall xA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{MAC},x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{Gen}^{MAC}=\\{((A),\\forall xA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{MAC},x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha}^{MAC}=\\{((A),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{MAC},A\\equiv_\\alpha^{MAC}B\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha}^{MAC}=\\{((A),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{MAC},A\\equiv_\\alpha^{MAC}B\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-Mac-Lane-公理族\">6. Mac Lane 公理族</h1>\n<p>Mac Lane 非逻辑公理集合为下列集合的并集：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Ext}=\\{\\forall a\\forall b(\\forall x(x\\in a\\leftrightarrow x\\in b)\\to a\\doteq b)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Ext}=\\{\\forall a\\forall b(\\forall x(x\\in a\\leftrightarrow x\\in b)\\to a\\doteq b)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Empty}=\\{\\exists e\\,\\operatorname{Empty}(e)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Empty}=\\{\\exists e\\,\\operatorname{Empty}(e)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Pair}=\\{\\forall a\\forall b\\exists p\\,\\operatorname{Pair}(p,a,b)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Pair}=\\{\\forall a\\forall b\\exists p\\,\\operatorname{Pair}(p,a,b)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Union}=\\{\\forall a\\exists u\\,\\operatorname{Union}(u,a)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Union}=\\{\\forall a\\exists u\\,\\operatorname{Union}(u,a)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Power}=\\{\\forall a\\exists p\\,\\operatorname{Power}(p,a)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Power}=\\{\\forall a\\exists p\\,\\operatorname{Power}(p,a)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Infinity}=\\{\\exists I\\,\\operatorname{Inductive}(I)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Infinity}=\\{\\exists I\\,\\operatorname{Inductive}(I)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\Delta_0Sep}\n=\\{\\forall a\\exists b\\forall x(x\\in b\\leftrightarrow(x\\in a\\wedge A)):\nA\\in\\Delta_0^{MAC},b\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{MAC}(A)\\cup\\{a,x\\}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\Delta_0Sep}\n=\\{\\forall a\\exists b\\forall x(x\\in b\\leftrightarrow(x\\in a\\wedge A)):\nA\\in\\Delta_0^{MAC},b\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{MAC}(A)\\cup\\{a,x\\}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Foundation}\n=\\{\\forall a(\\exists x(x\\in a)\\to\\exists x(x\\in a\\wedge\\forall y(y\\in x\\to\\neg y\\in a)))\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Foundation}\n=\\{\\forall a(\\exists x(x\\in a)\\to\\exists x(x\\in a\\wedge\\forall y(y\\in x\\to\\neg y\\in a)))\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{TC}^{MAC}=\\{\\forall a\\exists T\\,\\operatorname{TCover}(a,T)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{TC}^{MAC}=\\{\\forall a\\exists T\\,\\operatorname{TCover}(a,T)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{MAC}=\n\\mathsf{Ax}^{MAC}_{Log}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{Ext}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Empty}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Pair}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Union}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{Power}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Infinity}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\Delta_0Sep}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{Foundation}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{TC}^{MAC}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{MAC}=\n\\mathsf{Ax}^{MAC}_{Log}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{Ext}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Empty}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Pair}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Union}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{Power}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Infinity}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\Delta_0Sep}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{Foundation}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{TC}^{MAC}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-证明对象\">7. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{MAC}(\\Gamma,\\pi,A)\">\\(\\operatorname{Proof}_{MAC}(\\Gamma,\\pi,A)\\)</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{MAC}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{MAC}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span> 是非空有限序列</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\pi=(A_0,\\ldots,A_{m-1})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\pi=(A_0,\\ldots,A_{m-1})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\">\\(m&gt;0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_{m-1}=A\">\\(A_{m-1}=A\\)</span>、每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{MAC}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{MAC}\\)</span>，并且每行 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\">\\(A_i\\)</span> 满足下列条件之一：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma,\\qquad A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{MAC},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A_i\\in\\Gamma,\\qquad A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{MAC},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists j,k&lt;i\\ \\exists B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{MAC}\\ (A_k=(A_j\\to A_i)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists j,k&lt;i\\ \\exists B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{MAC}\\ (A_k=(A_j\\to A_i)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists j&lt;i\\ \\exists x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\,\n\\bigl(A_i=\\forall xA_j\\land x\\notin\\bigcup_{C\\in\\Gamma}\\operatorname{FV}_{MAC}(C)\\bigr),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists j&lt;i\\ \\exists x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\,\n\\bigl(A_i=\\forall xA_j\\land x\\notin\\bigcup_{C\\in\\Gamma}\\operatorname{FV}_{MAC}(C)\\bigr),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists j&lt;i\\ (A_j\\equiv_\\alpha^{MAC}A_i).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists j&lt;i\\ (A_j\\equiv_\\alpha^{MAC}A_i).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-可导关系与系统元组\">8. 可导关系与系统元组</h1>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{MAC}A\">\\(\\Gamma\\vdash_{MAC}A\\)</span> 当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{MAC}(\\Gamma,\\pi,A)\">\\(\\operatorname{Proof}_{MAC}(\\Gamma,\\pi,A)\\)</span>。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{MAC}=\n(\\mathsf{Var},\\mathsf{Term}_{MAC},\\mathsf{Frm}_{MAC},\\Delta_0^{MAC},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}^{MAC},\\operatorname{FV}_{MAC},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf T}^{MAC},\\operatorname{BV}_{MAC},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{T}^{MAC},\\operatorname{Sub}_{MAC},\n\\operatorname{FreeRen}_{MAC},\\operatorname{BoundRen}_{MAC},\\equiv_\\alpha^{MAC},\n\\operatorname{TCover},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\Delta_0Sep},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{MAC},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{MAC},\\mathsf{Rule}_{Gen}^{MAC},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha}^{MAC},\n\\operatorname{Proof}_{MAC},\n\\vdash_{MAC}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{MAC}=\n(\\mathsf{Var},\\mathsf{Term}_{MAC},\\mathsf{Frm}_{MAC},\\Delta_0^{MAC},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}^{MAC},\\operatorname{FV}_{MAC},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf T}^{MAC},\\operatorname{BV}_{MAC},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{T}^{MAC},\\operatorname{Sub}_{MAC},\n\\operatorname{FreeRen}_{MAC},\\operatorname{BoundRen}_{MAC},\\equiv_\\alpha^{MAC},\n\\operatorname{TCover},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\Delta_0Sep},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{MAC},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{MAC},\\mathsf{Rule}_{Gen}^{MAC},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha}^{MAC},\n\\operatorname{Proof}_{MAC},\n\\vdash_{MAC}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统的目标差异是包含幂集、无穷、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0\">\\(\\Delta_0\\)</span>-分离与传递覆盖公理；它不同于 ZFC，因为 Separation 只允许 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0\">\\(\\Delta_0\\)</span> 矩阵，并且完全不含 Replacement 模式。本条目采用不含选择的 MAC 版本，选择另在 MACC 中加入。该系统只含句法对象、句法操作、公理集合、推理规则和证明关系；不含解释结构、语义满足、真值定义、模型类或元定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-原始符号","text":"1. 原始符号","level":1},{"id":"2.-项与公式闭包","text":"2. 项与公式闭包","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变量、替换与-$\\alpha$-等价","text":"3. 自由变量、替换与 $\\alpha$-等价","level":1},{"id":"4.-$\\Delta_0$-与集合论缩写","text":"4. $\\Delta_0$ 与集合论缩写","level":1},{"id":"5.-逻辑公理与规则","text":"5. 逻辑公理与规则","level":1},{"id":"6.-Mac-Lane-公理族","text":"6. Mac Lane 公理族","level":1},{"id":"7.-证明对象","text":"7. 证明对象","level":1},{"id":"8.-可导关系与系统元组","text":"8. 可导关系与系统元组","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}","display":false}